# sgv-tweet-digest — keep secrets and per-user state OUT of the public repo.

# --- Secrets / credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.api_key
**/secrets/
**/*_api_key
**/x-cookies.json
**/*cookies*
**/*oauth*
twitter_oauth2.json
**/*.token
**/*.session
**/*.session-journal
**/*.session*

# --- The PRIVATE credential-handoff doc (never publish) ---
SECRETS-TO-SHARE.md

# --- The user's real config (only the .example ships) ---
config.json
!config.example.json

# --- The REAL anonymize denylist (only the .example ships) ---
anonymize_denylist.txt
!anonymize_denylist.example.txt

# --- Per-user runtime state / generated data ---
*.db
*.log
latest.json
state.json
stats.jsonl
insights_snapshot_*.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
